mes to test your brand and mess with  your friends from the makers of you  don't know jack jack box party pack  three comes with fun and frantic games  like trivia murder party a deadly quiz  show and  making it a sneaky game for tricksters  the best part is you don't need extra  controllers up to eight players can join  in on the fun using their phones tablets  or computers you can get party pack  three for Xbox one or ps4 for $24.99  if platformers are more your style try  Rayman legends  up to four players can play as Rayman  and Friends sharing the same screen as  your group progresses there is a wide  range of levels including special  musical levels which are incredibly fun  it's a gorgeous cartoonish good time and  still one of the best platformers on  current gen consoles get it for Xbox one  Wii U or ps4 for as low as $19.99 if you  want to combine cartoonish fun with a  shooter try plants vs. zombies garden  warfare 2 both the shooter and a tower  defense game the sequel to garden  warfare offers new classes and modes  with familiar gameplay this time around  the zombies have conquered and the  plants are on the attack you can play  with or against a friend in split-screen  across every mode get it for Xbox one or  ps4 for $39.99 for an even more chaotic  shooter check out enter the gungeon  enter the gungeon is an intense  shoot-'em-up dungeon crawler this game  is full tilt madness in co-op mode where  you shoot loot dodge roll and table flip  your way through the gungeon it can be a  bit frustrating but often with amusing  results download it on ps4 for $14.99  for kids of all ages there's minecraft  ps4 edition minecraft is pretty  recognizable now on the ps4 edition you  can play in co-op in two player and four  players split-screen modes this console  edition features two fun minigames tumbl  is a competitive mode where players  destroy the floor beneath each other's  feet battle is a fight for survival with  a choice of three maps get minecraft for  ps4 for $19.99 for the aspiring  musicians in your group jam out with  rock band for the latest version of rock  band offers the same familiar gameplay  of becoming a full band with a singer  guitarist bassist and drummer what's new  is the revamped world tour campaign mode  and freestyle solos there are thousands  of legacy tracks you can download which  is good because the built-in setlist  isn't the strongest get ready to rock  out on ps4 and Xbox one a full band at a  box bundle will set you back 160 $9.99  and finally for you Movers &amp; Shakers we  recommend just Stan's 2017 Just Dance  2017 allows up to six players to use  smartphones to play with a just dance  controller app get ready to bust and  move to new tracks like Justin Bieber's  sorry and see us keep thrills it's also  a lot of fun to see your friends sloppy  attempts at copying the dance moves as  best as they can you can get just dance  2017 for wii u ps4 and Xbox one for  $49.99 those are your top co-op games  this holiday season delivered by Pizza  Hut once you pick a game to share don't  forget to share some food with the Pizza  Hut triple treat box every specially  marked triple treat box includes $10 off  an Xbox game and a chance to win an Xbox  one s and a custom red Pizza Hut  controller Pizza Hut is giving them away  every hour until December 24th you can  find a code on the inside front flap of  a specially marked triple treat box and  enter it at Pizza Hut xbox one Escom for  a chance to instantly win an Xbox one s  happy gaming and happy eating  I'm chastity and I'll see you next time  [Music]  you

